+				<footer role="presentation">
+					<p epub:type="z3998:valediction">“In a tearing hurry,<br/>
+					Yours ever,<br/>
+					<span epub:type="z3998:signature">Laurie.</span>”</p>
+				</footer>
 			</blockquote>
 			<p>“Here’s richness!” cried Jo, flying in to tell the news to Meg.</p>
 			<p>“Of course we can go, mother? it will be such a help to Laurie, for I can row, and Meg see to the lunch, and the children be useful in some way.”</p>
